      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's still way too short. You're touching on the right points with the CHSH inequality, but you're barely scratching the surface. A student reading this once through is going to be lost because there's no depth. \n\nI need this to be a substantial document. I'm looking for several paragraphs worth of detail—walk through the math of the inequality, describe a specific experimental setup (like Aspect's experiment), and explain the conceptual shift from classical to quantum perspectives in a very thorough way. \n\nThe indexing score is still looking very low. Please, give me a truly deep dive. I'm still warning you: don't just give me a bunch of repetitive sentences to pad the length; I need actual, dense, high-level academic information. Try again, but make it much, much more exhaustive.",
      "source": "evaluator"
